Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 720
Set Height 432
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 24
Set Framerate 15
Set PlaybackSpeed 2.5

# Step 1: Show help
Type "ceph-calc --help" Sleep 50ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Ctrl+l
Sleep 500ms

# Step 2: Non-interactive calc
Type "ceph-calc --usable 100TB --repl 3" Sleep 50ms
Enter
Sleep 3.5s
Ctrl+l
Sleep 500ms

# Step 3: Compare all strategies
Type "ceph-calc --usable 100TB --compare" Sleep 50ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
